      "criterion": "Explanation of Mechanical and Chemical Digestion",
      "excellent": "Clearly and accurately distinguishes mechanical from chemical digestion with relevant examples from the Kenyan meal. Names at least three specific enzymes, correctly identifies each enzyme's substrate, product, and location in the alimentary canal. Explanation is logically sequenced from mouth to large intestine.",
